WEBVTT

00:11:58.488 --> 00:12:02.118
we knew people were taking 
a lot of photos on their mobile phones,

00:12:02.118 --> 00:12:04.558
so we built something 
called Google Photos,

00:12:05.268 --> 00:12:09.808
and it was how do we organise photos
better for everyone.

00:12:09.808 --> 00:12:13.468
We do it using AI, Artificial Intelligence

00:12:13.468 --> 00:12:15.618
and we really make it work well.

00:12:15.618 --> 00:12:19.208
So we always try to think about
how we can use technology

00:12:19.208 --> 00:12:21.378
to solve something 
better than everyone else.

00:12:22.068 --> 00:12:26.138
So basically, Sundar is always 
trying to make life better.

00:12:26.138 --> 00:12:30.668
Till this trial continues,
competition will keep ending on it's own.